   958                                  ; XGA's 64x64 hardware sprite is independent of the scanned framebuffer.
   959                                  ; These register values and sprite-data writes reproduce DREAMS.COM from
   960                                  ; dreams_xga_20260926_193007.img, the version the user verified in 86Box.
