  1145                                  ; Count completed panorama steps over at least 36 BIOS clock ticks (~2 s).
  1146                                  ; A slow frame can span several seconds; tick subtraction preserves that time.
  1147                                  ; This measures the guest animation loop, not host-window presentation.
